      ":question/id": "3e958238-ee2a-58d3-b257-eafe2e7f6b42",
      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-66805",
      ":question/problem": "Find the exact solution of the equation $5^{x} = 15$.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "We take $\\log_5$ of both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n5^x&=15\\\\\n\\log_5\\left(5^x\\right)&=\\log_5(15).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing $\\log_b(b^c)=c$, we obtain the exact solution\n\n$$\nx=\\log_5(15).\n$$"
    },
